  "collectionNotes": [
    "MIPI-DSI / DPI 图像传输未实现，当前不生成替代 framebuffer；产品尺寸/分辨率是硬件知识，不能当作显示运行通过。",
    "Goodix只在0x5D应答；未发明可控INT引脚来选择0x14。GT9271保留9271器件身份，复用官方BSP声明兼容的单点报告子集。",
    "GT911 触摸报告数字子集、I2C GPIO7/8、GPIO35 BOOT 已实现；多点、复杂配置与完整原厂界面未验证。",
    "TF 默认64MiB FAT32与已有P4 SDMMC数字模型；独立原厂文件系统挂载、C6无线、CSI、USB、音频模拟、Ethernet及模拟电源未验收。",
    "此配置使用虚拟 silicon rev1.00，仅用于匹配原始镜像范围；不是实物PCB修订声明，实际芯片应单独识别。",
    "原始出厂镜像固定提交/实际SHA，分区和每个ESP段checksum/SHA已审计；simulationVerified=false，未做本次原厂启动或实机验收。",
    "UIFlow1/2：本轮官方型号README/资源页没有列出精确目标镜像；上游专项核验未知。Xiaozhi可能作为官方Brookesia内部应用出现，但这不证明独立上游镜像可复用。",
    "3D 来源：official-cad；生产Three加载器/原生尺寸/屏幕射线/展开复位已检验；部分结构和光学尺寸有明确限制，未宣称浏览器WebGL或实物装配通过。",
    "No hardware-fit or browser/WebGL acceptance is implied by the retained CAD or CPU geometry checks.",
    "Factory display execution is independently recorded in product limitations; a model screen only shows the actual emulator framebuffer.",
    "Optional camera, purchased battery/header accessories and packaging differences are recorded in product knowledge. This mechanical asset depicts only components present in the retained manufacturer file.",
    "Only actual output uses framebuffer. Physical BOOT/PWR targets require separately calibrated source positions; product keyboard/button controls remain available.",
    "Colors are approximate and native component groups preserve exact source placement; no current PCB revision or internal electrical validation inferred from CAD.",
    "Published viewing opening62.28×110.32mm differs from720×1280 pixelaspect. Runtime uses62.055×110.32mm inside it; active area calibration remains unresolved."
  ]
